          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: soffriggere",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "soffriggere — \"to fry gently, to sauté\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Soffriggi la cipolla nell'olio. Fry the onion gently in the oil."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Low heat, a few minutes, a little oil."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "soffriggere joins so- \"under\", here \"gently\", from Latin sub, and friggere \"to fry\", from Latin frīgere (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
